  "common-default-rails/sine": "* quiz circuit\n* issue: floating_pin Q1.A\n* issue: value_out_of_range D1\n* issue: kind_not_allowed R1\n* issue: value_out_of_range L1\n* issue: floating_pin L1.1\n* issue: floating_pin U1.C\n* issue: floating_pin U1.B\n* issue: kind_not_allowed C1\n* issue: floating_pin R2.G\n* issue: floating_pin R2.S\n* issue: dangling_wire w4\n* issue: dangling_wire w5\n* issue: unconnected_port in+\nDQ1 n1 0 DZ_DQ1\nD1 0 0 DZ_D1\nRL1 n2 0 4.7e-6\nQU1 n3 n4 0 QPNP\nMR2 0 n5 n6 n6 NMOSE\n.model DZ_D1 D(IS=1e-14 BV=1e+3 IBV=1e-3)\n.model DZ_DQ1 D(IS=1e-14 BV=5.1e+0 IBV=1e-3)\n.model NMOSE NMOS(LEVEL=1 VTO=1 KP=1e-3)\n.model QPNP PNP(BF=100)\nVin in 0 SIN(5e-1 1e+0 1e+3)\nRload out outl 1e+12\nVmeas outl 0 0\n.tran 1e-5 5e-3 0\n.control\nset wr_vecnames\nset wr_singlescale\nrun\nlinearize v(in) v(out) i(Vmeas)\nwrdata /dev/stdout v(in) v(out) i(Vmeas)\n.endc\n.end\n",
